OL,3,ABayeux Tapestry goes on public display
OL,4,Ain UK for first time
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Bayeux Tapestry was originally
OL,7,Fembroidered in England but kept for
OL,8,Fcenturies in France, and tells the
OL,9,Fstory of the Norman conquest of England
OL,10,Fand the Battle of Hastings in 1066
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
